<title>BRAZIL: Brazil exports $3.398 bln so far in August.</title>
<headline>Brazil exports $3.398 bln so far in August.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil has exported $3.398 billion in goods so far in August, with a daily average of $199.9 million, a Ministry of Industry and Commerce spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said in the fourth week of the month exports totalled $925 million, averaging $186 million a day.</p>
<p>In July, Brazil posted a $334 million trade deficit, with daily average exports at $193.9.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
